# NAME|TYPE|INTERVAL_SECONDS|MAX|URL[|TTL=<duration>]
# TYPE: BLOCK (nft drops it), ALLOW (cancels a block), CHALLENGE (no nft:
# a challenge floor for web clients, [webdetector] LIST_CHALLENGE). There is
# no IGNORE type: never-block addresses go in cfm.ignore or IGNORE_IPS.
MYALLOW|ALLOW|3600|0|https://cfm.myip.gr/whitelist.txt
# The fleet blacklist (cfm-web: every node's reported bans, ~270k entries).
# Opt-in per node, not provisioned by cfm-web: uncomment to enforce it here.
# Keep the name MYBLOCK, which the docs and the proxied-ipfilter log use.
#MYBLOCK|BLOCK|3600|0|https://cfm.myip.gr/blacklist.txt
#SPAMDROP|BLOCK|14400|0|https://www.spamhaus.org/drop/drop.txt
#SPAMDROPV6|BLOCK|14400|0|https://www.spamhaus.org/drop/dropv6.txt
#SPAMEDROP|BLOCK|14400|0|https://www.spamhaus.org/drop/edrop.txt
#DSHIELD|BLOCK|14400|0|https://www.dshield.org/block.txt
# Tor exits (the Tor Project's own list, ~1.2k addresses, one per line; exits
# change daily, hence 1h). Exits only: a relay that is not an exit never sends
# a user's traffic, so a "full" relay list blocks servers, not visitors.
# CHALLENGE, not BLOCK: Tor also carries people (readers of news sites, the
# privacy-minded), and measured on 8 nodes (2026-11-26) Tor was <= 0.13% of
# the traffic, 62% of it the quoted-UA form-spam tool rule 202 flags. A
# CHALLENGE list is never written to nft: the web decision raises an
# uncleared listed client to a challenge, direct or behind Cloudflare alike
# ([webdetector] LIST_CHALLENGE, default log; docs/proxied-ipfilter.md).
# Mail and panel ports are untouched. BLOCK instead drops every Tor user on
# every port of this node.
#TOR|CHALLENGE|3600|0|https://check.torproject.org/torbulkexitlist
#BOGON|BLOCK|14400|0|http://www.cymru.com/Documents/bogon-bn-agg.txt
#HONEYPOT|BLOCK|14400|0|https://www.projecthoneypot.org/list_of_ips.php?t=d&rss=1
#CIARMY|BLOCK|14400|0|http://www.ciarmy.com/list/ci-badguys.txt
#BFB|BLOCK|14400|0|http://danger.rulez.sk/projects/bruteforceblocker/blist.php
#BDE|BLOCK|3600|0|https://api.blocklist.de/getlast.php?time=3600
#BDEALL|BLOCK|14400|0|http://lists.blocklist.de/lists/all.txt
#STOPFORUMSPAM|BLOCK|14400|0|http://www.stopforumspam.com/downloads/listed_ip_1.zip
#STOPFORUMSPAMV6|BLOCK|14400|0|http://www.stopforumspam.com/downloads/listed_ip_1_ipv6.zip
#GREENSNOW|BLOCK|14400|0|https://blocklist.greensnow.co/greensnow.txt
